{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":502555,"name":"","username":"hyper_core","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/h/85f322/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-28T11:01:11.547Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502555-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502555-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502555-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502555-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCan not connect to Ahref using marketplace connector. Throws SyntaxError with rate-limit reasons\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502555-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502555-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGoto your grokbot account\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSelect marketplace, search for Ahref connector\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdd connector, wait for Authenticate button to appear\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress “Authenticate”\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGet Error string at bottom\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502555-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502555-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnector should be able to authenticate and get added properly. No SyntaxError should occur as well\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502555-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502555-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"